                          "url": "https://www.cpsc.gov/Recalls/2026/Olympia-Tools-International-Recalls-Pack-N-Stroll-Utility-Wagons-Due-to-Risk-of-Serious-Injury-or-Death-from-Entrapment-and-Falls-Violates-Mandatory-Standard-for-Strollers"
